,"rec":[],"deck":2,"blurb":"Risen is a role-playing game from Piranha Bytes, makers of the Gothic series. Shipwrecked on a mysterious volcanic island, you find yourself caught between rival factions as earthquakes, monsters and ancient ruins appear.\n\nYou choose which side to join and how to fight, using swords, staffs or magic, and every action has consequences. The world is handcrafted and atmospheric, with tough combat that rewards learning. It is a single-player game for fans of classic European RPGs who like exploration and a gritty tone."}}